    <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2#DatasetShape/dct:isReferencedBy>, <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2#DatasetShape/dcat:keyword>,
    <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2#DatasetShape/dcat:landingPage>, <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2#DatasetShape/dct:language>,
    <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2#DatasetShape/dpv:hasLegalBasis>, <http://data.health-ri.nl/core/p2#DatasetShape/healthdcatap:maxTypicalAge>,
